paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙxHast thou faith? have it to thyself before God. Happy is he that condemneth not himself in that thing which he alloweth.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙpAnd he that doubteth is damned if he eat, because he eateth not of faith: for whatsoever is not of faith is sin.¦layout ªlast_verse